Our liability and insurance coverage include professional indemnity (€5,000,000), cyber liability (€2,000,000), and a limitation of liability (€3,000,000). These should provide adequate protection against potential risks associated with GDPR non-compliance, intellectual property disputes, or other contractual breaches.

